01:10:02.240 --> 01:10:03.640
He was having a hard time keeping

1526
01:10:03.640 --> 01:10:04.420
food down.

1527
01:10:04.680 --> 01:10:05.460
Oh my gosh.

1528
01:10:05.560 --> 01:10:08.320
And I'm sure you guys were like, we only have one day here.

1529
01:10:08.420 --> 01:10:09.100
What do you do?

1530
01:10:09.340 --> 01:10:10.220
You have to rally.

1531
01:10:10.700 --> 01:10:12.320
We had to shoot it.

1532
01:10:12.720 --> 01:10:15.340
First of all, to John's credit, you would never know he was

1533
01:10:15.340 --> 01:10:15.660
sick.

1534
01:10:15.780 --> 01:10:16.660
He was so amazing.

1535
01:10:17.220 --> 01:10:22.400
He was such a trooper, but he was really, really worried about giving me his

1536
01:10:22.400 --> 01:10:22.740
flu.

1537
01:10:23.200 --> 01:10:27.440
And he was kind of like, I am not going to kiss her on the lips and give her this flu.

1538
01:10:27.660 --> 01:10:28.080
That is

1539
01:10:28.080 --> 01:10:28.580
terrible.

1540
01:10:28.720 --> 01:10:29.380
I won't do it.

1541
01:10:29.580 --> 01:10:31.180
And I'm sure you were like, thank you.

1542
01:10:31.420 --> 01:10:32.180
I was.

1543
01:10:32.280 --> 01:10:33.040
I was like, okay,

1544
01:10:33.040 --> 01:10:34.140
but we didn't know.

1545
01:10:34.300 --> 01:10:35.360
Like, what are we going to do?

1546
01:10:35.680 --> 01:10:40.700
So in editing, Claire had the idea that she would

1547
01:10:40.700 --> 01:10:48.060
cut from the kind of fakie cheek kiss to a really good, real kiss back at the church ceremony.

1548
01:10:49.080 --> 01:10:51.920
And we just kind of hoped no one would notice.

1549
01:10:52.460 --> 01:10:55.020
It's true though, because everyone is waiting for

1550
01:10:55.020 --> 01:10:57.800
that magical kiss after they say I do.

1551
01:10:58.100 --> 01:10:58.480
Yeah.

1552
01:10:58.740 --> 01:11:00.480
And the church one is such a good one.

1553
01:11:00.940 --> 01:11:02.220
This all leads to

1554
01:11:02.220 --> 01:11:04.280
this beautiful talking head by Jim.

1555
01:11:04.520 --> 01:11:07.840
Greg shared with us that he assigned the talking head to Danny

1556
01:11:07.840 --> 01:11:08.140
Chun.

1557
01:11:08.700 --> 01:11:09.840
It's so lovely.

1558
01:11:09.980 --> 01:11:10.920
I think we should hear it.

1559
01:11:11.660 --> 01:11:14.040
I bought those boat tickets the day I saw that

1560
01:11:14.040 --> 01:11:14.680
YouTube video.

1561
01:11:15.660 --> 01:11:17.240
I knew we'd need a backup plan.

1562
01:11:17.360 --> 01:11:19.540
The boat was actually plan C, the church.

1563
01:11:19.840 --> 01:11:20.440
It was plan B.

1564
01:11:20.960 --> 01:11:25.000
And plan A was marrying her a long, long time ago.

1565
01:11:26.780 --> 01:11:28.000
Pretty much the day I met her.

1566
01:11:29.320 --> 01:11:35.320
And Claire Scanlon, our editor, shared that she fought really hard to keep this talking head in.

1567
01:11:35.660 --> 01:11:39.760
And she shared maybe if it would have been one of the guys, it might have gotten cut because everyone

1568
01:11:39.760 --> 01:11:41.900
did think the wedding ended on such a high note.

1569
01:11:42.280 --> 01:11:44.660
But she just loved this talking head.

1570
01:11:44.820 --> 01:11:45.280
And I think

1571
01:11:45.280 --> 01:11:47.060
it's so great that it stayed in.

1572
01:11:47.360 --> 01:11:49.600
I get goosebumps every time.

1573
01:11:49.840 --> 01:11:51.640
I just absolutely love it.

1574
01:11:52.260 --> 01:11:53.240
And once

1575
01:11:53.240 --> 01:11:58.420
again, our writers did that amazing thing they do where you go from this incredibly sweet moment

1576
01:11:58.420 --> 01:12:03.480
to Kevin putting his feet in the ice machine at the hotel.

1577
01:12:04.060 --> 01:12:07.560
And then to Michael and Pam's mom

1578
01:12:07.560 --> 01:12:09.940
sneaking into a hotel room together.

1579
01:12:10.540 --> 01:12:10.940
Yes!

1580
01:12:11.200 --> 01:12:11.760
What?!

1581
01:12:11.760 --> 01:12:12.820
What?!

1582
01:12:12.820 --> 01:12:15.680
And that is how Niagara ends,

1583
01:12:15.820 --> 01:12:16.260
you guys.

1584
01:12:16.880 --> 01:12:18.120
Oh, wow.

1585
01:12:18.360 --> 01:12:20.800
What fun re-watching this episode.

